  m_text: 'Congratulations! You''ve successfully built the city''s very first building!



    A
    building''s Happiness is determined by the 8 tiles immediately surrounding it:

    -
    Residential: Wants 5 Residential, 3 Commercial.  1-2 adjacent Industrial deducts
    1 pt; more deducts 2 pts.

    - Commercial: Wants 6 Residential, 2 Industrial.

    -
    Industrial: Wants 3 Residential, 5 Commercial.


    Plan your layout carefully
    to maximize your score! '
